# paperclip-link-health-rca

Read-only health RCA for Paperclip-linked fleet containers. Use `monolith-fleet fleet health`, inspect logs for degraded containers, correlate affected Paperclip work, and produce a Fleet Report with evidence, blast radius, proposal, rollback, and next safe step.

Guardrails: never restart, stop, mutate, or bypass Monolith approval gates.
